{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Introduction</h2><br>Olive Village... that was the name of this town, as well as this world.<br>This otherworldly town has a nostalgic, retro-like flavor.<br>For ages, it has prospered, and continues to prosper without end.<br>Every corner of the place is bustling with people, and warmth.<br>It is both old-fashioned, yet refreshingly new.<br><br>Neither magic nor spells exist here, but there is an aura of mystique.<br>How long has it been since I, Yumesaki Haruki, have come to this world?<br><br>It feels like it's been a few days. But it also feels like it's been over a year.<br>There is the passing of the day into night, back into day.<br>However, you don't feel the passage of time beyond that.<br>The flowers that have once blossomed continue to stay in full bloom.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Characters</h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/617430/extras/eb92e47e67e0b78369a393f2b7249789.avif?t=1720810913\" width=640 height=422 /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/617430/extras/870a6568a68dbccb04d03d139815742d.avif?t=1720810913\" width=640 height=422 /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/617430/extras/650523377e7db47fffb4276097a80980.avif?t=1720810913\" width=640 height=422 /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/617430/extras/9d37c651e1d40a71f54f37cf8642e819.avif?t=1720810913\" width=640 height=422 /></span><br><br>&quot;A Butterfly in the District of Dreams&quot; is the first visual novel release by <br>Japanese developer, Life A Little. Originally released in Japan in 2013, the<br>game features:<br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Updated from the 2014 Japanese release<br></li><li>Fully Voiced in Japanese (except for the main character)<br></li><li>HD Graphics<br></li><li>Multiple routes and endings with each of the three main heroines.</li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/617430?t=1720810913","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/617430/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1720810913","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/617430/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1720810913","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/617430/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1720810913","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Trading Cards","id":29},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Introduction</h2><br>Olive Village... that was the name of this town, as well as this world.<br>This otherworldly town has a nostalgic, retro-like flavor.<br>For ages, it has prospered, and continues to prosper without end.<br>Every corner of the place is bustling with people, and warmth.<br>It is both old-fashioned, yet refreshingly new.<br><br>Neither magic nor spells exist here, but there is an aura of mystique.<br>How long has it been since I, Yumesaki Haruki, have come to this world?<br><br>It feels like it's been a few days. But it also feels like it's been over a year.<br>There is the passing of the day into night, back into day.<br>However, you don't feel the passage of time beyond that.<br>The flowers that have once blossomed continue to stay in full bloom.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Characters</h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/617430/extras/eb92e47e67e0b78369a393f2b7249789.avif?t=1720810913\" width=640 height=422 /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><im